<title>USA: USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</title>
<headline>USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average lost more than 50 points in early morning trading on Friday as the bond market tumbled following the release of two key economic numbers for March.</p>
<p>The Dow was off 50.50 points at 6,489.55, which activated the New York Stock Exchange's limits on program trading.</p>
